flowchart LR
  UI[Next.js UI<br/>Chat / Admin] -->|REST + SSE| API[FastAPI Backend]
  API --> G[LangGraph Agent]
  G --> Guard[guard<br/>input and safety]
  Guard --> Agent[agent<br/>LLM plus tools]
  Agent -->|tool_calls| Tools[tools<br/>retry validate timeout]
  Tools --> Agent
  Agent -->|final| Finalize[finalize<br/>structured AgentReply]
  Agent -->|limits or handoff tool| Handoff[handoff<br/>ticket plus webhook]
  Tools --> RAG[RAG<br/>pgvector search]
  Tools --> Mock[Mock APIs<br/>orders shipping calendar CRM]
  G --> PG[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
  RAG --> PG
  Handoff -->|optional WEBHOOK_URL| Ext[n8n / Slack]
